{"v":4,"catch":"享受你的像素魔法吧！","desc":"玩 Pixel 3 畫圖，在 95 個像素藝術創作關卡中釋放您的創造力！ \n遊戲提供了自動填充和提示等有用的功能，可讓您的藝術之旅順利進行。 \n從各種美麗、獨特的畫布中選擇您的想像。 \n探索像素藝術的無限可能性，一次一個像素，將您的藝術願景變為現實！\n\n- 從 95 件精美的藝術作品中進行選擇！\n- 使用方便的縮放和放大工具，不錯過任何一個像素！\n- 從頭開始選擇並玩任意關卡！","publisher":"Ocean Media","release":"2024-12-26","genres":["益智","桌上遊戲"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文","荷蘭文","葡萄牙文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/aa58af3b0d552978a9f2c1eddcc6e37600743f55f1747f67899dcc068bb6cda7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1f2fb2033f2d78174b77c7af76f73b64a0fe2dc5080f8566c23f25e9029f3ed8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/990bacb3968737b8d07d483112a84fb3f2135216c4efae0137c6d3875eb3aa01.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e5d8c61ad25894ebba9cc135cb7f96d29d47b0fb1b7b6c92eb8487e8bad4f474.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/298da7cd30f1b33441b264d59c9a09f485a3d1587824a0f345b27b8ed4a739d7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4b47ee538a8074349be6ee769454074fabb38a5ba1a4a9a2eeebc15ae7be8716.jpg"],"titleId":"0100e97020dbc000","dlc":[]}